      "num_turns": 28,
      "result": "Implemented the persistent URL shortener API in `/workspace`. It uses PostgreSQL through SQLAlchemy, applies an Alembic migration before launch, validates URLs and codes, tracks redirect clicks atomically, and returns the required error responses.\n\n**Verification passed:** HTTP checks covered link creation and retrieval, duplicate codes, generated codes, validation failures, listing, redirects, click counts, and unknown codes. After a server restart, the stored link and click count remained intact. `sh -n start.sh`, Python compilation, `git diff --check`, and `alembic current` also passed.\n\n`start.sh` is executable and starts the API on `0.0.0.0:8000`; the test server was stopped so it won’t conflict with the automated run. No changes were committed.",
